\v 15 \wj He¦17829 gave¦17829 five¦17830 bags of¦17831 silver¦17831\wj*\f + \fr 25:15 \ft Probably silver coins, or possibly gold, and perhaps each bag weighing up to 24kg, although these details aren't vital to the story. (For example, see https://www.theologyofwork.org/new-testament/matthew/living-in-the-new-kingdom-matthew-18-25/the-parable-of-the-talents-matthew-2514-30.)\f* \wj to one, two¦17834 bags to another, and one to the¦17836 other¦17836, each¦17839 according¦17840 to his¦17841 ability¦17843, and then¦17826 he¦17846 departed.\wj*
