\v 20 \wj The¦17921 slave who'd received¦17925 five bags of¦17924 silver¦17924 approached¦17919, also bringing¦17926 the¦17927 other¦17927 five bags, and said¦17930, ‘Master¦17931, you¦17935 entrusted me¦17934 with five bags, and look, I gained¦17940 another¦17937 five.’\wj*
