\v 23 \wj ‘Well¦18000 done¦18000, good¦18003 and faithful slave¦18002,’ said¦17995 the¦17997 master. ‘You¦18009 were¦18009 faithful over¦18007 a few¦18008 things, so I'll¦18015 put you¦18014 in charge of¦18020 a lot more things. Come¦18016 and join your¦18022 master in celebrating.’\wj*
